<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were firm to</p>
<p>$0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  58.50-59.50, few 58.00 and 60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs.  42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs.  44.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  46.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  48.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
</text>
